# Server-only secrets. NEVER prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# Copy to .env.local for `next dev` / `next start`.
# Production: Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables
# (Production + Preview). Leave "Sensitive" on. Do not expose to browser.
#
# Without these, Platforms.tsx still tries a public scrape of
# @bel.conteudos and often returns "—" when IG/TikTok block the server.

# --- Instagram (Graph API) ---
# 1. Instagram account must be Professional (Creator or Business).
#    App → Settings → Account type and tools.
# 2. Create a Meta app: https://developers.facebook.com/apps
#    Add product "Instagram" (Instagram API with Instagram Login,
#    or Facebook Login for Business).
# 3. Permissions: instagram_business_basic (Instagram Login)
#    or instagram_basic + pages_read_engagement (Facebook Login).
# 4. Graph API Explorer → generate a User token with those scopes,
#    then exchange for a long-lived token (~60 days):
#    GET https://graph.instagram.com/access_token
#      ?grant_type=ig_exchange_token
#      &client_secret=APP_SECRET
#      &access_token=SHORT_LIVED_TOKEN
#    Refresh before expiry:
#    GET https://graph.instagram.com/refresh_access_token
#      ?grant_type=ig_refresh_token
#      &access_token=LONG_LIVED_TOKEN
# 5. INSTAGRAM_USER_ID is the IG professional numeric id, not the
#    username. From Explorer: GET /me/accounts then
#    GET /{page-id}?fields=instagram_business_account
#    or GET /me?fields=user_id on graph.instagram.com.
# 6. Paste the long-lived token + id below (and in Vercel).

INSTAGRAM_ACCESS_TOKEN=
INSTAGRAM_USER_ID=

# --- TikTok (Open API v2) ---
# 1. Create an app: https://developers.tiktok.com
#    Enable Login Kit / TikTok API.
# 2. Redirect URI must match exactly. Scope: user.info.stats
#    (follower_count) plus user.info.basic.
# 3. Authorize @bel.conteudos:
#    https://www.tiktok.com/v2/auth/authorize/?client_key=KEY
#      &scope=user.info.basic,user.info.stats
#      &response_type=code&redirect_uri=YOUR_URI
# 4. Exchange the code (server-side):
#    POST https://open.tiktokapis.com/v2/oauth/token/
#    grant_type=authorization_code
# 5. Access token lasts ~24h. Store it here. Refresh with
#    grant_type=refresh_token (refresh_token lasts ~365d).
#    The site reads TIKTOK_ACCESS_TOKEN only — refresh is manual
#    unless you add a cron later.

TIKTOK_ACCESS_TOKEN=

# --- Portfolio reels ---
# Preferred: unlisted YouTube (or Shorts) URL in src/data/reels.ts
#   videoUrl: videoUrl("unboxing", "ForBiggerBlazes.mp4", "https://youtu.be/ID")
# Fan loads youtube-nocookie iframe only on play. Posters stay tiny.
#
# Optional mp4 CDN if you skip YouTube:
#   ./scripts/compress-reel.sh ~/Downloads/unboxing.mov unboxing
#   Upload to R2/Blob as {slug}.mp4, then:
NEXT_PUBLIC_REELS_CDN=
